Dreaming so hard until you cried

00:18:38.440 --> 00:18:43.250
itsudatte kimirashiku star

00:18:38.440 --> 00:18:43.250
It's like you as always, star

00:18:43.250 --> 00:18:46.610
chikazuiteru

00:18:43.250 --> 00:18:46.610
You're getting closer

