I want to follow you

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:51.260
Only a minute remaining!

00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:54.300
<i>All right!</i>

00:19:54.300 --> 00:19:55.470
<i>Just as I imagined!</i>

00:19:55.470 --> 00:19:57.260
Ryou!

00:20:00.770 --> 00:20:02.230
<i>Not yet?!</i>

00:20:02.230 --> 00:20:02.640
Full speed!

00:20:02.640 --> 00:20:03.390
Go!  Go!

00:20:03.390 --> 00:20:05.190
Full speed!

00:20:05.190 --> 00:20:07.070
Taira!

00:20:09.360 --> 00:20:10.940
Capeta!

00:20:10.940 --> 00:20:12.700
Capeta...

00:20:20.550 --> 00:20:21.660
All right!

00:20:21.660 --> 00:20:24.460
Shiba, 1 minute 45.913 seconds!

00:20:24.460 --> 00:20:27.540
A wonderful best lap, following Ishihara!

00:20:28.300 --> 00:20:29.000
Capeta.

00:20:34.840 --> 00:20:35.960
He did it!

00:20:35.960 --> 00:20:37.820
45-second range!

00:20:41.540 --> 00:20:43.350
N-No way!

00:20:44.280 --> 00:20:46.310
T-Taira's also...!

00:20:46.310 --> 00:20:50.280
<b>It's the same time down to 0.001 of a second!</b>

00:21:00.970 --> 00:21:03.610
<b>Final session, finished!</b>

00:22:50.880 --> 00:22:53.320
1 minute 45.913 seconds.

00:22:53.700 --> 00:22:57.440
To think that both their times are the same down to 0.001 of a second!

00:22:57.440 --> 00:23:00.660
Then, who is going to pass?!

00:23:00.660 --> 00:23:01.950
Next time, on Capeta.

00:23:01.950 --> 00:23:03.250
Perfect Win!

00:23:03.250 --> 00:23:05.040
Open up the future!
